title Power-based level 3 on a 4% hill: rider eases at 100 W, then pushes 250 W (physics)

# Level 3 in power mode (flags 0x81 = PAS | PAS_POWER): 100 W + 2 W/rpm x
# cadence from the battery, capped at 60%. Same gear throughout, so harder
# pedalling means a higher cadence and more assist. With the standard fixed
# current (14%) the motor gives 175 W at both efforts.
config pas_keep_current_percent 100
config level 3 flags 129
config level 3 target_current_percent 60

at 0 level 3
at 0 grade 4
at 0 gear 1.6
at 1000 rider_w 100
at 21000 rider_w 250

end 41000

# ~200 W of motor at 100 W of rider (16%), ~260 W at 250 W (21%).
expect 20000 current == 16
expect 40000 current == 21
